 "resourceRule": "Every resource leaf is read. Its bytes are committed when the payload measures as text, when it decodes to a structure (RT_VERSION, RT_STRING), or when it is at most 65536 bytes; larger binary payloads are recorded with size and sha256 and their bytes discarded, which is this repo's art-and-sound rule applied by measurement. Nothing is skipped because of its type.",
